  [OBS-02] Logs, metrics, and traces are complementary, not interchangeable.
  [OBS-03] Alert on symptoms, not causes.
  [OBS-04] Every service MUST expose health checks.
  [OBS-05] Sensitive data MUST be redacted in all observability outputs.
  [OBS-06] Observability data MUST be classified (PUBLIC, INTERNAL, CONFIDENTIAL, SECRET).

